      "title": "4 步加速说明",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 4 步 Turbo 加速（本工作流相对清理版的唯一改动）\n\n**需要手动下载 LoRA（1.82 GB）放到**\n\n`ComfyUI/models/loras/minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_4step_v0.1_comfyui_bf16.safetensors`\n\nHF 直链：\nhttps://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/loras/minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_4step_v0.1_comfyui_bf16.safetensors\n\n未下载前这个 LoRA 节点会标红、点运行会报找不到模型——属正常。\n\n已改参数：\n- 链路 UNET → **LoRA** → PathchSageAttentionKJ → MemoryEfficientPatch → Director\n- 高级采样组 `steps = 4`（原清理版为 25）\n- LoRA 强度 1.0；其余参数与清理版完全一致（960×544 / 124 帧 / cfg 1.0 / res_multistep + simple / shift 12 & 3）"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
